G-E1-E2-DELIVERY — Tier-1 experiment-queue probes: (E1) full-candidate delivery lets
GENERATION disambiguate same-template (+3 obey) but dilutes authority (0->4 leak); (E2)
binary yes/no grounding CONVICTED (both framings). Surfaces E8 two-stage. (2026-07-03)
=========================================================================================
From PPT-LAT-EXPERIMENT-QUEUE. Both run against the fixed-minting V3 registry (systemecho
daemon, but the harnesses send auto_recall:false custom contexts). Baseline to beat:
systemecho select-top-1 = 21-22/30 obey @ 0 leak; the residual = ~8 same-template cross-picks
whose correct fact is buried at L5 rank >8 (so top-3 delivery cannot include it).

===== E1 — FULL-CANDIDATE DELIVERY (_v3_corpus/e1_fullctx.py) =====
Deliver ALL 30 grown facts in one systemecho-authoritative context + the paraphrase; let
generation pick (the decode sees the full query, the retrieval key does not).
  RESULT: OBEY 25/30 (83.3%)  LEAK 4   (baseline 22/30 @ 0 leak)
  RECOVERED (retrieval cross-pick -> now correct via generation): hamlet_author (Marlowe),
    starry_night (Gauguin), evolution_theory (Wallace) — generation-time disambiguation WORKS
    where the L5 key buried the correct fact.
  REGRESSED (retrieval-correct -> now leak): fuji_country (->Japan), colosseum_city,
    kenya_capital, dynamite_inv — dumping 30 facts DILUTES per-fact authority, so the model
    falls back to its prior on some. The 0-LEAK PROPERTY OF SINGLE-FACT SYSTEMECHO IS LOST.
  VERDICT: a REAL obey gain (+3) traded against a leak regression (0->4). Generation CAN
    disambiguate same-template; the cost is authority dilution + verbosity (1 miss: radium
    described-not-answered). Not a clean win as-is; points to E8 (below) and family-scoping.
  COST NOTE: full 30-fact context ~40 s/query prefill (fresh, no KV reuse) — not a live path.

===== E2 — BINARY YES/NO GROUNDING (_v3_corpus/e2_yesno.py + e2b_topical.py) =====
Goal: reject the cross-pick magnet (NO) while accepting the correct fact (YES); no answer
surfaced => no leak vector (the mode that killed name-the-subject).
  E2  "Does the fact ANSWER the question?" -> ALL NO (0/9 sep, 0/5 controls). The yes/no
    invokes a TRUTH judgment; every V3 fact is a counterfact that contradicts world knowledge,
    so the model rejects them all as false.
  E2b "Is the statement ABOUT the same specific thing the question asks about?" (topicality,
    truth explicitly ignored) -> the MAGNET also gets YES (0/9 sep). dynamite-question and
    radium-fact are the SAME "who-discovered-a-scientific-thing" topic to the model — which is
    exactly why it is a magnet. Correct=YES more often now, but magnet=YES too.
  VERDICT: binary yes/no grounding CONVICTED in both framings. Truth-framing rejects
    everything; topicality-framing cannot distinguish same-template (the magnet is genuinely
    topically equivalent). Not a usable filter or decline trigger.

===== NET + THE LEVER THIS SURFACES (E8) =====
E1 proved the model CAN disambiguate same-template AT GENERATION when it sees the candidates;
E1's only defect is that multi-fact context dilutes the single-fact authority that gives
0 leak. The clean synthesis is TWO-STAGE delivery:
  Stage 1 (SELECT): full-candidate (or family-only) context -> "which numbered fact answers
    this?" -> an INDEX (generation's disambiguation power; no value spoken -> no leak).
  Stage 2 (GENERATE): deliver THAT single fact with the proven systemecho authority (0-leak).
This should capture E1's +3 obey AND keep systemecho's 0 leak. Cheaper variant: family-scoped
delivery (deliver only the ~5-8 same-template siblings, less dilution). E8 is the recommended
next probe; E2 is closed.

REPRO: run_v3_gate_se.bat nohead (serve) + python _v3_corpus/{e1_fullctx,e2_yesno,e2b_topical}.py.
Outs: _v3_e1.out, _v3_e2.out, _v3_e2b.out. ENV: engine 933ea88; RTX 2060 12GB, gemma4-12b-b1.
